{"4674520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tiny Factions", "steam_appid": 4674520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Your Kingdom, Prepare Your Airships, and Conquer Infinite Islands!</strong> Tiny Factions is a pixel-art medieval strategy game that blends classic RTS (Real-Time Strategy) mechanics with deep city management and survival elements. You are not just commanding an army; you are the beating heart of a living kingdom that rebels, burns, and rises from the ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Economy and City Building:</strong> Don't just place buildings, create production chains! Build workshops, boost your economy, and use these resources to turn your city into a massive fortress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/33f92553e6b9809cf9ba057bea683d6b.poster.avif?t=1782929875\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/33f92553e6b9809cf9ba057bea683d6b.webm?t=1782929875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/33f92553e6b9809cf9ba057bea683d6b.mp4?t=1782929875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Airship Invasions:</strong> Break geographical borders! Board your airships and conquer an infinite number of islands, from snowy peaks to vast deserts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/dca364e1807b8ae81a4f9d614ac37065.poster.avif?t=1782929875\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/dca364e1807b8ae81a4f9d614ac37065.webm?t=1782929875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/dca364e1807b8ae81a4f9d614ac37065.mp4?t=1782929875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living City and Justice System:</strong> Your city is not just made of buildings. Deal with thefts, riots, and external attacks. Catch thieves and throw them in jail to earn passive income, or if you don't want to bother building a prison, execute them directly! The choice is yours.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/27bcc3df085aa65c673f9b707f7bd34d.poster.avif?t=1782929875\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/27bcc3df085aa65c673f9b707f7bd34d.webm?t=1782929875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/27bcc3df085aa65c673f9b707f7bd34d.mp4?t=1782929875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Battles Full of Surprises:</strong> The battlefield is never safe. Be prepared for ghost armies or powerful enemy bosses appearing suddenly in the heat of battle! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/0fb51c2a31dbcc6bdca66f77d89e4437.poster.avif?t=1782929875\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/0fb51c2a31dbcc6bdca66f77d89e4437.webm?t=1782929875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/0fb51c2a31dbcc6bdca66f77d89e4437.mp4?t=1782929875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Combat Balance:</strong> Spearmen, Swordsmen, and Cavalry... Build the right strategy. The wrong move destroys your army, the right move saves your kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Customization:</strong> Name your kingdom, choose your soldiers' armor colors, and most importantly, draw your own flag pixel by pixel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOW TO PLAY? (QUICK GUIDE)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Lay the Foundations (Economy)</strong> Everything starts with production. First, build your Workshops. The stronger your economy, the more invincible your army becomes. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/61c1350f216e5cfc58e70d8d5c9171f0.poster.avif?t=1782929875\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/61c1350f216e5cfc58e70d8d5c9171f0.webm?t=1782929875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/61c1350f216e5cfc58e70d8d5c9171f0.mp4?t=1782929875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Defense Layout</strong> Enemies and rebels won't stand idle! Build your city strategically. During an attack, villagers will take shelter in their homes; however, buildings can be set on fire and the villagers inside can perish in the flames. Keep your defense line strong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Master the Military Balance</strong> To dominate the battlefield, never forget this formula:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spearmen:</strong> Experts at stopping Cavalry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cavalry:</strong> Swiftly crushes Swordsmen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swordsmen:</strong> Breaks through Spearmen shields. <i>(Note: During battle, you can change the camera position with left-click on the mini-map HUD in the bottom right, and zoom with the mouse wheel.)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. Explore and Conquer</strong> Organize expeditions to new islands using your Airships. In domination points, the more you hold, the faster your unit production time gets. Every island you conquer grants you a permanent Perk. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/8ff7f78b4416af0de8a163b92f83c385.poster.avif?t=1782929875\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/8ff7f78b4416af0de8a163b92f83c385.webm?t=1782929875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/8ff7f78b4416af0de8a163b92f83c385.mp4?t=1782929875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5. Create Your Identity</strong> Define your kingdom's visual identity using the Customization panel. Design that unique emblem that will be the nightmare of your enemies with the flag drawing tool. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/6f7da5d708d3fe90609bbdaa960ddd96.poster.avif?t=1782929875\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/6f7da5d708d3fe90609bbdaa960ddd96.webm?t=1782929875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/6f7da5d708d3fe90609bbdaa960ddd96.mp4?t=1782929875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>GAME MODES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign:</strong> An epic tale of conquest that gets progressively harder, pushing your strategic skills to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Game:</strong> Choose your biome and name, and jump right into the battle!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer's Note:</strong> The AI might surprise you. Just like a human, it looks for your flaws and attacks at your weakest moment. Now put on your crown and carve your name into the history of Tiny Factions!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Your Kingdom, Prepare Your Airships, and Conquer Infinite Islands!</strong> Tiny Factions is a pixel-art medieval strategy game that blends classic RTS (Real-Time Strategy) mechanics with deep city management and survival elements. You are not just commanding an army; you are the beating heart of a living kingdom that rebels, burns, and rises from the ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Economy and City Building:</strong> Don't just place buildings, create production chains! Build workshops, boost your economy, and use these resources to turn your city into a massive fortress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/33f92553e6b9809cf9ba057bea683d6b.poster.avif?t=1782929875\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/33f92553e6b9809cf9ba057bea683d6b.webm?t=1782929875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/33f92553e6b9809cf9ba057bea683d6b.mp4?t=1782929875\" type=\"video/mp4\"><