e! Build your city strategically. During an attack, villagers will take shelter in their homes; however, buildings can be set on fire and the villagers inside can perish in the flames. Keep your defense line strong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Master the Military Balance</strong> To dominate the battlefield, never forget this formula:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spearmen:</strong> Experts at stopping Cavalry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cavalry:</strong> Swiftly crushes Swordsmen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swordsmen:</strong> Breaks through Spearmen shields. <i>(Note: During battle, you can change the camera position with left-click on the mini-map HUD in the bottom right, and zoom with the mouse wheel.)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. Explore and Conquer</strong> Organize expeditions to new islands using your Airships. In domination points, the more you hold, the faster your unit production time gets. Every island you conquer grants you a permanent Perk. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/8ff7f78b4416af0de8a163b92f83c385.poster.avif?t=1782929875\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/8ff7f78b4416af0de8a163b92f83c385.webm?t=1782929875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674520/extras/8ff7f78b4416af0de8a163b92f83c385.mp4?t=1782929875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5. Create Your Identity</strong> Define your kingdom's visual identity using the Customization panel. Design that unique emblem that will be the nightmare of your enemies with the flag drawing tool. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" auto